{"4616210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scarecrow Simulator", "steam_appid": 4616210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what life is like from the perspective of a scarecrow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not the farmer.Not the king.Not the chosen hero destined to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a scarecrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Scarecrow Simulator, a cozy medieval idle experience where your greatest achievement is standing in a field... and somehow becoming a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a living medieval world unfold around you as villagers work, seasons pass, crops grow, and distant windmills turn beneath the sun. You may not move much, but that doesn't mean nothing is happening. Every moment brings progress, rewards, discoveries, and new ways to customize your loyal field guardian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique scarecrow skins, climb global leaderboards, collect rewards, and become the most admired scarecrow the countryside has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing medieval idle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable scarecrow skins and cosmetic rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful countryside environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy atmosphere with satisfying progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes adventure means slaying dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes adventure means watching wheat grow while a crow judges you from a fence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And honestly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second option is much more relaxing.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what life is like from the perspective of a scarecrow?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not the farmer.Not the king.Not the chosen hero destined to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a scarecrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Scarecrow Simulator, a cozy medieval idle experience where your greatest achievement is standing in a field... and somehow becoming a legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch a living medieval world unfold around you as villagers work, seasons pass, crops grow, and distant windmills turn beneath the sun. You may not move much, but that doesn't mean nothing is happening. Every moment brings progress, rewards, discoveries, and new ways to customize your loyal field guardian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock unique scarecrow skins, climb global leaderboards, collect rewards, and become the most admired scarecrow the countryside has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing medieval idle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable scarecrow skins and cosmetic rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful countryside environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy atmosphere with satisfying progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes adventure means slaying dragons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes adventure means watching wheat grow while a crow judges you from a fence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And honestly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second option is much more relaxing.</p>", "short_description": "No swords. No dragons. No heroic destiny. Just you, a scarecrow, standing proudly in a medieval field while the world grows around you. Surprisingly relaxing. Surprisingly addictive.", "supported_languages": "French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Danish, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, No